<section class="section section--line" id="bundles">
  <div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow reveal">Built for bigger cooks</span><h2 class="display display--lg reveal">Bundle the smoke.</h2></div><p class="lead reveal">Save on curated combinations made for weekends, gifts and serious grill sessions.</p></div><div class="grid bundle-grid" id="bundle-grid"></div></div>
</section>
<section class="story-split">
  <div class="story-split__visual"><img src="/assets/images/logo-bull.png" alt="Mills Smoke & Grill bull logo"></div>
  <div class="story-split__content"><div><span class="eyebrow">Made around the fire</span><h2 class="display display--lg">No weak seasoning.</h2><p class="lead">Mills Smoke & Grill is built on one simple idea: every cook deserves a rub with enough character to stand up to smoke, heat and time.</p><div class="story-points"><div class="story-point"><span class="story-point__number">01</span><div><h4>Layered flavour</h4><p>Salt, sweetness, smoke, herbs and heat are balanced for a complete finish.</p></div></div><div class="story-point"><span class="story-point__number">02</span><div><h4>Real versatility</h4><p>Clear pairings and instructions help first-time grillers and pitmasters get results.</p></div></div><div class="story-point"><span class="story-point__number">03</span><div><h4>Built to look premium</h4><p>Strong shelf presence makes every jar gift-worthy and instantly recognisable.</p></div></div></div><a class="btn btn--dark" href="/story" style="margin-top:30px">About Us <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5"/></svg></a></div></div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow reveal">Cook with confidence</span><h2 class="display display--lg reveal">Fire-tested recipes.</h2></div><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/recipes">See all recipes <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5"/></svg></a></div><div class="grid recipe-grid"><% if (recipes && recipes.length) { %><% recipes.forEach((recipe,i)=>{ %><article class="recipe-card reveal <%= i?'reveal-delay-'+i:'' %>" style="--recipe-bg:<%= recipe.mainImageUrl ? `url('${recipe.mainImageUrl}') center/cover` : 'linear-gradient(145deg,#3c160b,#0b0806 70%)' %>"><div class="recipe-card__content"><div class="recipe-card__meta"><span><%= recipe.cookTime || 'Smokehouse recipe' %></span><span><%= recipe.rubPairing || 'Mills' %></span></div><h3><%= recipe.title %></h3><a href="/recipes/<%= recipe.slug %>" class="recipe-card__link">Open recipe →</a></div></article><% }) %><% } else { %><article class="recipe-card reveal"><div class="recipe-card__content"><div class="recipe-card__meta"><span>Coming soon</span><span>Mills Smoke & Grill</span></div><h3>New recipes are on the way.</h3><a href="/recipes" class="recipe-card__link">Visit recipes →</a></div></article><% } %></div></div></div>
</section>
<section class="section section--line"><div class="container reviews"><div class="review-score reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Backyard approved</span><strong>4.9</strong><div class="review-score__stars">★★★★★</div><p class="muted">Sample launch reviews for layout demonstration.</p></div><div class="review-stack"><article class="review reveal"><p>“The Original Smoke blend gave our ribs a proper dark crust without turning them salty. It tasted like we had cooked all day.”</p><div class="review__author"><strong>Jordan M.</strong><span>Verified buyer · Original Smoke</span></div></article><article class="review reveal"><p>“Sweet Heat is exactly the balance I wanted—caramelised on the outside, warm at the end, and still full of flavour.”</p><div class="review__author"><strong>Alex R.</strong><span>Verified buyer · Sweet Heat</span></div></article><article class="review reveal"><p>“The flavour finder recommended Coastal Char. It is now permanently beside the grill for prawns and fish.”</p><div class="review__author"><strong>Taylor S.</strong><span>Verified buyer · Coastal Char</span></div></article></div></div>
</section>
<section class="section section--tight"><div class="container"><div class="newsletter reveal"><div><span class="eyebrow" style="color:#280c02">Join the smoke signal</span><h2 class="display display--md">New drops. Better cooks.</h2><p>Get recipes, product releases and grilling tips delivered without the noise.</p></div><form class="newsletter-form" id="smoke-newsletter-form"><input type="email" name="email" aria-label="Email address" placeholder="Your email address" required><button class="btn btn--dark" type="submit">Join now</button><small id="newsletter-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></small></form></div></div></section>
<script>document.getElementById('smoke-newsletter-form')?.addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=e.currentTarget,m=document.getElementById('newsletter-message'),b=f.querySelector('button');b.disabled=true;m.textContent='Joining…';try{const r=await fetch('/api/newsletter/subscribe',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({email:f.email.value})});const d=await r.json();if(!r.ok)throw Error(d.error||'Unable to subscribe.');m.textContent=d.message;f.reset();}catch(err){m.textContent=err.message;}finally{b.disabled=false;}});</script>
